{"week": 12, "title": "Measuring what matters", "speaker": "Nicky Barton", "beats": [
 {"set": "stage", "say": "Week twelve: measuring what matters. Nicky Barton, Head of Marketing Science at Mutinex, on how marketers work out what actually works.", "board": {"photo": "photos/w12.jpg", "title": "Measuring **what matters**", "name": "Nicky Barton", "org": "Head of Marketing Science, Mutinex"}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 1, "at": "aisle"}, {"id": "s2", "look": "student", "v": 2, "at": "aisle2"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "Nicky", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Mutinex helps brands find what drives sales. GrowthOS reads the market, Nicky's team translates, and brands decide where the next dollar goes.", "board": {"title": "Good decisions need **evidence**", "steps": [{"text": "**GrowthOS** reads the market", "cue": "GrowthOS"}, {"text": "**The team** translates", "cue": "team"}, {"text": "**Brands** decide the next dollar", "cue": "brands decide"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "an", "look": "worker", "v": 2, "at": "desk", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "ceo", "look": "exec_f", "v": 1, "at": "table"}], "acts": [{"who": "ceo", "cue": "decide", "pose": "chin"}], "fx": [{"kind": "chart", "who": "an", "cue": "reads"}, {"kind": "money", "who": "ceo", "cue": "dollar"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "translates", "shot": "actor", "who": "an"}, {"cue": "decide", "shot": "two", "who": "ceo"}]}, 
 {"set": "street", "say": "London, 1854. Cholera spread through Soho and experts blamed bad air. But data on where the deaths happened pointed to the water.", "board": {"title": "London, **1854**", "vs": {"left": "Experts said", "right": "Data said", "leftItems": ["Bad air"], "rightItems": ["The water"], "cue": "experts"}}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front", "pose": "chin"}, {"id": "doc", "look": "elder", "v": 3, "at": "l", "pose": "up", "expr": "stern"}, {"id": "w", "look": "worker", "v": 5, "at": "r", "hold": "clipboard", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "w", "cue": "water", "pose": "point", "expr": "shock"}], "fx": [{"kind": "say", "who": "doc", "text": "It's the bad air!", "cue": "blamed"}, {"kind": "exclaim", "who": "w", "cue": "water"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "blamed", "shot": "two", "who": "doc"}, {"cue": "data", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "water", "shot": "close", "who": "w"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Marketing had the same problem. For decades it ran on surveys, sales data months late, and the gut feel of the most senior person in the room.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front"}, {"id": "boss", "look": "exec", "v": 5, "at": "c", "pose": "hips", "expr": "stern"}, {"id": "j1", "look": "worker", "v": 1, "at": "table", "hold": "clipboard", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "j2", "look": "exec_f", "v": 4, "at": "table2"}], "acts": [{"who": "host", "cue": "surveys", "pose": "shrug"}, {"who": "boss", "cue": "gut", "pose": "point"}, {"who": "j2", "cue": "senior", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "nervous"}], "fx": [{"kind": "clock", "who": "j1", "cue": "months"}, {"kind": "say", "who": "boss", "text": "Trust my gut.", "cue": "gut"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "gut", "shot": "actor", "who": "boss"}, {"cue": "room", "shot": "close", "who": "j2"}]}, 
 {"set": "home", "say": "Then tracking grew. Banner ads showed clicks, AdWords intent, analytics visits, Facebook and the iPhone who you are, and the pixel what you buy.", "board": {"title": "Seeing a bit **more**", "steps": [{"text": "**Banner ads**: clicks", "cue": "Banner"}, {"text": "**AdWords**: intent", "cue": "AdWords"}, {"text": "**Analytics**: visits", "cue": "analytics"}, {"text": "**Facebook, iPhone**: who you are", "cue": "Facebook"}, {"text": "**The pixel**: what you buy", "cue": "pixel"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "tv", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "a", "look": "student", "v": 3, "at": "sofa", "mode": "sit", "hold": "phone", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "a", "cue": "who", "expr": "nervous"}], "fx": [{"kind": "eye", "who": "a", "cue": "who"}, {"kind": "money", "who": "a", "cue": "buy"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "who", "shot": "actor", "who": "a"}, {"cue": "pixel", "shot": "wide"}]}, 
 {"set": "stage", "say": "So last touch became the default: the last click gets all the credit. It's a group assignment where whoever hits submit gets the whole mark.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "lectern", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 4, "at": "l", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "s2", "look": "student", "v": 5, "at": "front"}, {"id": "s3", "look": "student", "v": 6, "at": "r"}], "acts": [{"who": "s1", "cue": "submit", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "s2", "cue": "whole", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "shock"}, {"who": "s3", "cue": "mark", "pose": "hips", "expr": "stern"}], "fx": [{"kind": "tick", "who": "s1", "cue": "submit"}, {"kind": "say", "who": "s2", "text": "I wrote it!", "cue": "whole"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "group", "shot": "two", "who": "s1"}, {"cue": "whole", "shot": "close", "who": "s2"}]}, 
 {"set": "plaza", "say": "Picture this shopper. She saw a billboard, heard the radio, then clicked a search ad. The billboard gets zero credit, the search ad a hundred percent.", "board": {"title": "Who gets the **credit**?", "bars": [{"label": "Billboard", "value": 0, "display": "0%", "cue": "zero"}, {"label": "Search ad", "value": 100, "display": "100%", "cue": "hundred"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front"}, {"id": "sh", "look": "shopper", "v": 1, "at": "walkR", "to": "l", "hold": "phone", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "sh", "cue": "billboard", "expr": "smile"}, {"who": "sh", "cue": "clicked", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "host", "cue": "zero", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "nervous"}], "fx": [{"kind": "eye", "who": "sh", "cue": "billboard"}, {"kind": "think", "who": "sh", "text": "That song again", "cue": "radio"}, {"kind": "cross", "who": "host", "cue": "zero"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "radio", "shot": "two", "who": "sh"}, {"cue": "zero", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "So budgets flow to the bottom of the funnel, brand looks useless, and mental availability shrinks. Nike went direct, pulled back from retail, and people stopped seeing it.", "board": {"title": "Starving the **brand**", "steps": [{"text": "**Awareness**", "cue": "brand"}, {"text": "**Consideration**", "cue": "useless"}, {"text": "**Conversion** gets the money", "cue": "mental"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "cmo", "look": "exec", "v": 2, "at": "table", "expr": "smile"}], "acts": [{"who": "cmo", "cue": "budgets", "pose": "point", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "cmo", "cue": "stopped", "pose": "chin", "expr": "pained"}], "fx": [{"kind": "money", "who": "cmo", "cue": "budgets"}, {"kind": "question", "who": "cmo", "cue": "stopped"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "Nike", "shot": "two", "who": "cmo"}, {"cue": "stopped", "shot": "close", "who": "cmo"}]}, 
 {"set": "home", "say": "Then privacy broke tracking. Safari limits, GDPR, then Apple's ask app not to track pop-up. Meta estimated that one pop-up cost it ten billion dollars in a year.", "board": {"title": "One **pop-up**", "big": "$10B", "caption": "Meta's own estimate of **one year's** cost", "cue": "ten"}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "l", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "a", "look": "shopper", "v": 3, "at": "sofa", "mode": "sit", "hold": "phone", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "a", "cue": "ask", "expr": "smile_closed"}, {"who": "host", "cue": "ten", "pose": "up", "expr": "shock"}], "fx": [{"kind": "tick", "who": "a", "cue": "pop-up"}, {"kind": "money", "who": "host", "cue": "billion"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "Apple's", "shot": "actor", "who": "a"}, {"cue": "Meta", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Ask every platform how much it sold and the answers add up to over a hundred percent. Everyone did the assignment.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front", "pose": "chin"}, {"id": "p1", "look": "exec", "v": 7, "at": "l"}, {"id": "p2", "look": "exec_f", "v": 6, "at": "c"}, {"id": "p3", "look": "exec", "v": 8, "at": "r", "mirror": true}], "acts": [{"who": "p1", "cue": "sold", "pose": "up", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "p2", "cue": "answers", "pose": "up", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "p3", "cue": "hundred", "pose": "up", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "host", "cue": "Everyone", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "dazed"}], "fx": [{"kind": "say", "who": "p1", "text": "That was us!", "cue": "sold"}, {"kind": "say", "who": "p3", "text": "No, us!", "cue": "hundred"}, {"kind": "question", "who": "host", "cue": "Everyone"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "hundred", "shot": "actor", "who": "p3"}, {"cue": "Everyone", "shot": "close"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Enter marketing mix modelling. Weekly sales, media spend, price, promotions, seasons, the economy and competitors go in. Out come what drove sales, ROI by channel and the next dollar.", "board": {"title": "Marketing **mix modelling**", "vs": {"left": "Weekly data in", "right": "Out comes", "leftItems": ["Sales, media spend", "Price, promotions", "Seasons, economy, rivals"], "rightItems": ["What drove sales", "ROI by channel", "The next dollar"], "cue": "Weekly"}}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "an", "look": "worker", "v": 2, "at": "desk", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}], "fx": [{"kind": "chart", "who": "an", "cue": "Out"}, {"kind": "bulb", "who": "host", "cue": "next"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "Out", "shot": "actor", "who": "an"}, {"cue": "ROI", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "stage", "say": "It's probabilistic, not deterministic. Not this click caused this sale, but the most likely effect, and how sure we are. More honest, and privacy safe.", "board": {"title": "More **honest**", "vs": {"left": "Deterministic", "right": "Probabilistic", "leftItems": ["This click caused this sale"], "rightItems": ["Most likely effect", "How sure we are"], "cue": "probabilistic"}}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 7, "at": "aisle"}], "acts": [{"who": "s1", "cue": "honest", "pose": "up", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "tick", "who": "s1", "cue": "safe"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "honest", "shot": "actor", "who": "s1"}]}, 
 {"set": "plaza", "say": "A cafe on a busy corner gets walk-ins with zero ads. That's baseline. And ads keep working after they stop, like a song stuck in your head.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front"}, {"id": "c1", "look": "worker", "v": 6, "at": "walkL", "to": "shop", "walkCue": "walk-ins"}, {"id": "c2", "look": "shopper", "v": 2, "at": "r", "hold": "coffee", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "host", "cue": "baseline", "pose": "point"}, {"who": "c2", "cue": "song", "expr": "whistle"}], "fx": [{"kind": "think", "who": "c1", "text": "Need coffee anyway", "cue": "walk-ins"}, {"kind": "heart", "who": "c2", "cue": "song"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "walk-ins", "shot": "actor", "who": "c1"}, {"cue": "song", "shot": "close", "who": "c2"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Add the fifth slice of pizza: returns diminish. Last year's star channel may not be the next best bet. And test first, like a flight simulator.", "board": {"title": "How the **model** thinks", "steps": [{"text": "**Busy cafe**: baseline", "cue": "start"}, {"text": "**Stuck song**: ads carry over", "cue": "start"}, {"text": "**Fifth slice**: returns diminish", "cue": "diminish"}, {"text": "**Last year's star**: averages lie", "cue": "star"}, {"text": "**Flight simulator**: test first", "cue": "simulator"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "e", "look": "worker", "v": 3, "at": "table", "hold": "box", "pose": "hold", "expr": "pained"}], "fx": [{"kind": "think", "who": "e", "text": "No more pizza", "cue": "slice"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "slice", "shot": "actor", "who": "e"}, {"cue": "star", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Across eighty-three brands in Australia and New Zealand, many drifted to performance. Those keeping brand muscle grew most. Yet cinema, radio and free-to-air, the longest lasting channels, were cut first.", "board": {"title": "83 brands, **modelled**", "lines": [{"text": "Drifting to **performance**", "cue": "drifted"}, {"text": "**Brand muscle** grew most", "cue": "muscle"}, {"text": "Longest lasting channels **cut first**", "cue": "cinema"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "cmo", "look": "exec_f", "v": 7, "at": "table"}], "acts": [{"who": "cmo", "cue": "muscle", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "cmo", "cue": "cut", "pose": "chin", "expr": "nervous"}], "fx": [{"kind": "stars", "who": "cmo", "cue": "grew"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "muscle", "shot": "two", "who": "cmo"}, {"cue": "cinema", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "street", "say": "If you can't add budget, don't add channels. Spreading money thinner shrinks results, and brands that go off air pay later.", "board": {"title": "Don't spread **thin**", "lines": [{"text": "Same channels, more budget: **+4.3%**", "cue": "budget"}, {"text": "More channels, more budget: **+2%**", "cue": "channels"}, {"text": "More channels, budget cut: **-6.8%**", "cue": "thinner"}, {"text": "Big budget cut: **-8.1%**", "cue": "off"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "m", "look": "exec", "v": 9, "at": "kerb", "hold": "clipboard", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "m", "cue": "shrinks", "expr": "pained"}], "fx": [{"kind": "cross", "who": "m", "cue": "shrinks"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "shrinks", "shot": "close", "who": "m"}, {"cue": "later", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Measurement has moved from the marketing report to the boardroom. The CEO asks what revenue and profit this created, and the CFO trusts the budget.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front"}, {"id": "ceo", "look": "exec", "v": 1, "at": "table", "pose": "chin"}, {"id": "cfo", "look": "exec_f", "v": 2, "at": "table2", "hold": "card", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "mk", "look": "worker", "v": 7, "at": "board", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "ceo", "cue": "revenue", "pose": "point", "expr": "stern"}, {"who": "cfo", "cue": "trusts", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "say", "who": "ceo", "text": "What did it earn?", "cue": "revenue"}, {"kind": "tick", "who": "cfo", "cue": "trusts"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "CEO", "shot": "actor", "who": "ceo"}, {"cue": "trusts", "shot": "close", "who": "cfo"}]}, 
 {"set": "plaza", "say": "The numbers get easier to produce, so judgement becomes the job. The best marketers bring curiosity, comfort with numbers, commercial sense and storytelling.", "board": {"title": "Judgement is **the job**", "lines": [{"text": "**Curiosity**: but did it work?", "cue": "curiosity"}, {"text": "Comfort with **numbers**", "cue": "comfort"}, {"text": "**Commercial** sense", "cue": "commercial"}, {"text": "**Storytelling**", "cue": "storytelling"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 8, "at": "c", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "s2", "look": "student", "v": 9, "at": "r"}], "acts": [{"who": "s2", "cue": "storytelling", "pose": "present", "expr": "grin"}], "fx": [{"kind": "question", "who": "s1", "cue": "curiosity"}, {"kind": "bulb", "who": "s2", "cue": "storytelling"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "curiosity", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "storytelling", "shot": "close", "who": "s2"}]}, 
 {"set": "stage", "say": "So: last touch misleads, privacy broke tracking, and modelling reads the whole market. Keep your brand muscle, and always ask, how do we know it worked? That's week twelve.", "board": {"title": "Week 12 **takeaways**", "lines": [{"text": "Last touch **misleads**", "cue": "Last"}, {"text": "**Modelling** reads the whole market", "cue": "modelling"}, {"text": "Keep your **brand muscle**", "cue": "Keep"}, {"text": "How do we **know** it worked?", "cue": "always"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 1, "at": "aisle"}, {"id": "s2", "look": "student", "v": 2, "at": "aisle2"}], "acts": [{"who": "host", "cue": "That", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}, {"who": "s1", "cue": "week", "pose": "cheer"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "week", "shot": "wide"}]}]}